  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Technical and Vocational education and Training in East Jerusalem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the overall objective of &#x2018;Increasing demand for and access to an improved learning and educational environment for technical and vocational education and training (TVET) in East Jerusalem, the expected results of the project  are upgrading and supporting the operationalization of the 3 TVET units in existing vocational schools, establishing 2 TVET schools in South of East Jerusalem, supporting an existing TVET school, enhancing awareness and understanding of the potential of TVET education for improving employability and improving the engagement of private sector, SMEs and established self-employed persons, to provide mentorship, internship and apprenticeship opportunities for TVET graduates. UNDP is the implementing partner and the youth in East Jerusalem are the target group.</narrative>
  </description>
